{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0cf874a234fa94fa9b065da7256d87d30229bb798c34a7eabbd3fe5e7f22635a", "ja": "遊園地ライブの翌日……", "zh": "游乐园演唱会的第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "aceae0ba9d39ad01231dd23b4a32816db55c411dd50416e7c1fefc514dd94e7e", "ja": "パレードを観るなら、二手に分かれないとですよね。\nそうなるとご飯は先……いや、でも……むむむっ……。", "zh": "要看游行的话，就得分成两组才行吧。这样一来，得先吃饭……不，可是……唔唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "8b9231b821ac23c9628a2f96dc80146e705f5a27d47a4aad45dd2fbcaefe9708", "ja": "お疲れ様、亜利沙。\n難しい顔して、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，亚利沙。\n皱着眉头，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "1f7de4691efa4d1872828799cb6ec59264f286b7f9d926a622e016ef577d14d6", "ja": "あ、プロデューサーさん、お疲れ様です！\nその……攻略プランを作ってたんです。遊園地の。", "zh": "啊，制作人，辛苦了！\n那个……我正在制定攻略计划。游乐园的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "05eadfe2a3244639d6d46d43354528b72cbdbaf317ee53189d1de79c96d5c0a3", "ja": "え、遊園地の攻略プラン……て、昨日行ったばかりで？\nあはは、さては遊び足りなかったな？", "zh": "诶，游乐园的攻略计划……可是昨天才刚去过吧？\n哈哈，看来是还没玩够吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "f1208de54bf6d3fff1ac14e36c2f2d44d9b18787ca567cb7a0b3a80c14f9ce35", "ja": "はい。……そう、遊び足りない気持ちをそっと押し隠す\n桃子ちゃんセンパイと、それを察するみなさん……。", "zh": "对。……没错，桃子前辈悄悄掩饰着还没玩够的心情，而大家也察觉到了这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "91491a3caf34925188cefe0ccd23065e620d724a526cb6adf9555573d006c8c6", "ja": "はぁ～っ、尊い！\nというわけで、今度もう一度行くことになりまして♪", "zh": "啊～太珍贵了！\n所以呢，我们决定下次再去一次♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "45c56239042561abcc8661d8190213e3a6aa0736ab91ab2cd598b4e3589e3de2", "ja": "なるほど、それでプラン作りってことか。", "zh": "原来如此，所以是在制定计划啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "62c46efeb821515d238b5449790e263d2dbdc917de77096a7a734a93d84c06e9", "ja": "はい！　みなさんがお好きなアトラクションや\nイベント情報に、いざという時の休憩スポット！", "zh": "没错！大家喜欢的游乐设施和活动资讯，还有关键时刻可以休息的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb81cab0a1bfc573aae18656db07ee2156409d52731c4df7708e191d30d0e709", "ja": "さらに、奈緒ちゃんも大満足のレストラン情報！\nみなさんの趣味嗜好をすべて網羅してみせますよ～！", "zh": "还有让奈绪也大为满意的餐厅信息！\n大家的兴趣爱好，我会全部一网打尽哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "6ce778728a56844b1911ae30fa12008ed5960d771bfedc4d9a08f5bac1a8241e", "ja": "うん、さすが亜利沙だな。\nきっとみんなも喜んでくれるよ。", "zh": "嗯，真不愧是亚利沙啊。\n大家肯定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "daa30d9d8d7d9f042992e18ac424844e021f70138d12a9aca195bb574a0a0e2b", "ja": "えへへ。ありさ、データ集めは得意ですから♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。收集数据可是亚利沙的拿手好戏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "b69a77dc2a85a6d8575459ca6627de02075e434c648583680c21d020958c44ed", "ja": "でも、もしかしたらだけど……、\nそのデータ、肝心な情報が抜けてないか？", "zh": "不过，虽然只是有这种可能……你的数据，会不会漏掉了最关键的信息？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb50e83be07b41c257fbedf3a11caef0e0bf1760563d670746adc8417016937f", "ja": "え？　いえ、そんなことありませんよ？\nありさのデータベースは完璧なはず……。", "zh": "咦？不，不是那样的吧？\n亚利沙的数据库应该是完美无缺的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "37c0bdb22a6a3236d13e240e167bb4b83ab6d07cea77b01cc36c315b1e7c2d5e", "ja": "Team4thのみなさんのことも、\nあんなことやこんなことまで盛りだくさんです！", "zh": "关于Team4th的各位，\n从那种事到这种事，全～部都非常丰富哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "a82f211b533b3323f9a33287e391a79659f80481b763877b843b48f96029f9b2", "ja": "そ、そうか。それはそれとして……。\nじゃあ、亜利沙のあれこれも、反映されてるのかな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。不过先不说这个……  \n那么，关于亚利沙的方方面面，也都有体现出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "b82bc684427ac0b39708210717bec2af5de779e7c4e494315553f9f83a3009f6", "ja": "！　そ、それは……みなさんと遊びに行けるだけで、\nありさには十分ご褒美なので、別に……。", "zh": "！那、那是……光是能和大家一起出去玩，对亚利沙来说就已经是足够的奖励了，所以没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "8a7c9ac434721c072f02e325b239e8b999a4c2ef7ef69002f57ffd9cb94c8bca", "ja": "遠慮しないほうがいいと思うけど。亜利沙も\n「Team4thのみなさん」に違いないんだぞ？", "zh": "我觉得你还是别客气比较好。亚利沙也肯定是“Team4th”的一员啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "598c9589571b20b3c720628c548223e8f2d337342ffa797039de685ff1ce6bc9", "ja": "よければ俺も一緒に行こうか？　写真係とかで。", "zh": "如果你不介意，要不要我也一起去？我可以负责拍照什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "df6281f50e8c6286626f1ef8efff6449935e1b7701d6561426a71b2d20d5c6cd", "ja": "あ、大丈夫です。\n写真係は、ありさがやるので間に合ってます。", "zh": "啊，没关系。\n摄影的工作由亚利沙来负责就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "fc254c0821918690348a77f3a9d61783c68b3dfc63cca29c70b1e75e60e82869", "ja": "えっ……。\nいやでも、亜利沙も遊ばないと……。", "zh": "诶……。\n不行，但是亚利沙也得一起玩才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2946550080179defc952fb3a550206f160a2170d4123a7213cdbfdb8547a66e", "ja": "大丈夫です！　アイドルちゃんのシャッターチャンスは\n見逃せないんです。二度とないんですよぉ～！！", "zh": "没关系的！小偶像们的绝佳快门时机\n我可不能错过。机会可不会有第二次啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0433_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "3cfcc9a7068b800819021b77a9dad21684011e48c19f9eb235f944774e19c49a", "ja": "そ、そっか！\nうん、わかった……！", "zh": "这、这样啊！\n嗯，我明白了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
